      "content": "Since you're looking for home remedies, you might try a combination of rest in a dark, quiet room and over-the-counter pain relievers like ibuprofen, but you must be very careful with dosage. If your usual migraine medications aren't helping this intense episode, it's a sign you need a more thorough evaluation. For a headache that feels \"way worse than usual,\" even if you have a history of migraines, it is always safer to consult a medical professional.",
