      "content": "thanks. honestly i feel like i'm just overreacting because i've been so stressed lately. if i just take a really high dose of ibuprofen, like like 1000mg or maybe even 1200mg at once, do u think that would knock this out? i usually take much less so i'm not sure if i should just go big to get it over with so i can just sleep it off... do u think that's a safe way to handle a spike like this?",
